        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2f781b9181f9b89e4089",
          "document_start": 313,
          "document_end": 342,
          "text": "但对于几何形状复杂的问题，其精度将降低，甚至发生求解困难。",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 313,
          "end": 342,
          "chunk_start": 313,
          "chunk_end": 342,
          "sentence_document_start": 313,
          "sentence_document_end": 342,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c13ddc87f4ef98d087de",
          "document_start": 342,
          "document_end": 415,
          "text": "另一类数值分析方法是有限元方法，有限元方法把一个连续体系统离散成有限个单元，每个单元采用近似函数表示，采用“有限个单元”组成的系统近似连续体系统。",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 342,
          "end": 415,
          "chunk_start": 342,
          "chunk_end": 415,
          "sentence_document_start": 342,
          "sentence_document_end": 415,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_94af8b8fce075d298d13",
          "document_start": 415,
          "document_end": 469,
          "text": "有限元方法具有如下的优点：物理概念清晰，对于力学问题，有限元方法一开始就从力学角度进行简化，易于掌握和应用；",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 415,
          "end": 469,
          "chunk_start": 415,
          "chunk_end": 469,
          "sentence_document_start": 415,
          "sentence_document_end": 469,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9e30828617e240287d3d",
          "document_start": 469,
          "document_end": 564,
          "text": "良好的灵活性与通用性，有限元方法对于各种复杂的因素（例如复杂的几何形状，任意的边界条件，不均匀的材料特性，结构中包含杆件、板、壳等不同类型的构件）都能灵活地加以考虑，而不会发生处理上的困难。",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 469,
          "end": 564,
          "chunk_start": 469,
          "chunk_end": 564,
          "sentence_document_start": 469,
          "sentence_document_end": 564,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9b48c9f94163c7b060e6",
          "document_start": 566,
          "document_end": 586,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 566,
          "end": 586,
          "chunk_start": 566,
          "chunk_end": 586,
          "sentence_document_start": 566,
          "sentence_document_end": 586,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a72a081d30433f844f24",
          "document_start": 587,
          "document_end": 603,
          "text": "# 1.2.3 有限元分析方法;",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 587,
          "end": 603,
          "chunk_start": 587,
          "chunk_end": 603,
          "sentence_document_start": 587,
          "sentence_document_end": 603,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_46c204a4311affc451b0",
          "document_start": 604,
          "document_end": 636,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 604,
          "end": 636,
          "chunk_start": 604,
          "chunk_end": 636,
          "sentence_document_start": 604,
          "sentence_document_end": 636,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2216e160459b93bea538",
          "document_start": 638,
          "document_end": 704,
          "text": "有限元方法也是求解物理场（位移场、热场、流场、电场、磁场）问题的有效数值计算方法，自从其问世以来就得到了工程界的高度重视和广泛应用。",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 638,
          "end": 704,
          "chunk_start": 638,
          "chunk_end": 704,
          "sentence_document_start": 638,
          "sentence_document_end": 704,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_34a3f1d53353c14a73ce",
          "document_start": 704,
          "document_end": 773,
          "text": "有限元方法最初用来求解复杂结构的应力分布，直至20世纪70年代，随着计算机技术的发展和有限元理论的成熟才开始广泛应用于动力学问题的求解中。",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 704,
          "end": 773,
          "chunk_start": 704,
          "chunk_end": 773,
          "sentence_document_start": 704,
          "sentence_document_end": 773,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_53c3d56a54327e824041",
          "document_start": 773,
          "document_end": 821,
          "text": "目前，有限元方法在动力学问题中的应用可以考虑各种非线性因素影响，进行建模和数值分析，主要表现在：",
          "section_id": "section_f9660ff20e45",
          "start": 773,
          "end": 821,
          "chunk_start": 773,
          "chunk_end": 821,
          "sentence_document_start": 773,
          "sentence_document_end": 821,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
